    {
      "id": 10388246069557,
      "title": "Scalp Stimulator",
      "handle": "scalp-serum-hair",
      "body_html": "<p data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"625\">Experience targeted hair restoration with our Batana Scalp Serum — a concentrated treatment designed to stimulate growth, repair damage, and soothe irritated scalps. Powered by <strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"483\">pure Batana oil</strong>, this lightweight formula penetrates deep into the scalp to restore bald spots, strengthen thinning areas, and support long-term hair health.</p>\n<p data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"657\">✨ <strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"655\">What makes it special:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"923\">\n<li data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"707\">\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"707\">Helps regrow edges and fill in thinning spots</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"770\">\n<p data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"770\">Rich in essential fatty acids, vitamin E, and antioxidants</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"819\">\n<p data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"819\">Lightweight, non-greasy formula absorbs fast</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"873\">\n<p data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"873\">Roller-tip applicator for mess-free, targeted use</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"923\">\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"923\">Ideal for locs, braids, and protective styles</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"1088\">Whether you’re just starting your growth journey or trying to bounce back from breakage, our Batana Scalp Serum gives your roots the support they need — naturally.</p>",
