      "title": "Batana Shampoo + Conditioner Set",
      "handle": "batana-natural-hair-growth-shampoo-conditioner-set",
      "body_html": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Complete Hair Care</strong>: The Azure Batana Shampoo &amp; Conditioner Set provides a balanced regimen for cleansing, nourishing, and revitalizing hair.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Powered by Pure Batana Oil</strong>: Enriched with Batana oil to strengthen, hydrate, and enhance natural shine.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Hydrating and Restorative</strong>: Shampoo gently cleanses while the conditioner deeply moisturizes, perfect for dry or damaged hair.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Safe for All Hair Types</strong>: Ideal for all hair types, especially beneficial for textured, curly, and color-treated hair.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Chemical-Free Formula</strong>: Free from sulfates, parabens, and synthetic additives for a natural, gentle hair care experience.</li>\n</ul>",
