      "body_html": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Complete Hair Growth System</strong>: The Azure Ultimate Batana Growth Bundle includes Batana Oil, Refined Batana Oil, Shampoo, and Conditioner—everything you need for healthy, fuller hair.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Pure Batana Power</strong>: Featuring 100% pure Batana Oil and Refined Batana Oil for deep nourishment and targeted hair and scalp treatment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Gentle Cleanse &amp; Hydration</strong>: Batana Shampoo and Conditioner work together to cleanse, hydrate, and strengthen, leaving hair soft and shiny.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Promotes Stronger, Thicker Hair</strong>: Nourishes roots, restores moisture, and reduces breakage to support natural hair growth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>All-Natural Formula</strong>: Free from sulfates, parabens, and harsh chemicals for a clean, effective hair care experience.</li>\n</ul>",
