      "title": "Batana Refined Oil",
      "handle": "batana-refined-oil",
      "body_html": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Ultra-Pure &amp; Refined</strong>: Azure Refined Batana Oil offers the purest form of Batana, processed for a lighter feel and faster absorption.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Nutrient-Rich Formula</strong>: Packed with vitamins and essential fatty acids to deeply nourish hair and scalp.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Non-Greasy Finish</strong>: Lightweight and non-greasy, perfect for daily use without buildup.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Ideal for Hair &amp; Skin</strong>: Soothes and hydrates both hair and skin, promoting softness, shine, and resilience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>100% Natural</strong>: Free from additives and chemicals, providing pure Batana benefits in a refined, premium oil.</li>\n</ul>",
